<%# app/views/pages/privacy.html.erb — minimal, honest privacy policy %>
<main class="prose prose-invert mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-14">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: <%= Date.today.strftime("%B %Y") %></em></p>
  <h2>What this site collects</h2>
  <p>This site collects minimal analytics (page views, referrers, country) to understand what content is useful. It does not sell personal data.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Essential cookies only, unless you interact with an embedded third-party service (e.g. a scheduling widget), which sets its own cookies under its own policy.</p>
  <h2>The tools</h2>
  <p>The developer tools on this site run entirely in your browser. Any values you enter are never sent to a server.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy: use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
</main>
